msgid "Wait correctly and shut down an explicit owner"
msgstr "正确等待并停止显式 owner"

msgid ""
"Use this guide for applications selecting an optional Native, FreeRTOS or "
"ThreadX adapter. The application owns tasks, stacks, notifications, queues "
"and execution progress. Baremetal has no scheduler. Platform start never "
"starts a kernel. The [OS contract](../design/os-contracts.md) remains "
"authoritative."
msgstr ""
"选择可选 Native、FreeRTOS 或 ThreadX adapter "
"的应用使用本指南。应用拥有任务、栈、通知、队列和执行进度。裸机没有调度器。平台启动从不启动内核。[OS 合同](../design/os-"
"contracts.md)保持权威。"

msgid "Avoid lost completion and unbounded waits"
msgstr "避免丢失完成和无限等待"

msgid ""
"Use the request's latched predicate as truth. Check the completion "
"predicate, arm the notification sequence, recheck, wait with the same "
"absolute monotonic deadline, then recheck again. Wakes are hints and may be "
"coalesced or unrelated. On timeout, perform the contract's final predicate "
"observation. Do not restart a relative budget after each hint and do not "
"block the only executor that must make progress."
msgstr ""
"以请求的锁存谓词为权威。先检查完成谓词，调用 `arm` "
"快照通知序列，再次检查，以同一绝对单调截止时间等待，然后再次检查。唤醒只是提示，可能合并或与当前请求无关。超时后执行合同要求的最后一次谓词观察。不得在每次提示后重新开始相对时间预算，也不得阻塞唯一负责推进的执行者。"

msgid ""
"![Predicate, wake and explicit shutdown "
"responsibilities](../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"
msgstr "![谓词、唤醒与显式停机责任](../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"

msgid "Predicate, wake and explicit shutdown responsibilities"
msgstr "谓词、唤醒与显式停机责任"

msgid ""
"FIG-08 shows the current wait/wake responsibilities. A provider IRQ sink "
"must respect the selected kernel syscall ceiling; an unqualified priority "
"cannot call an ISR kernel API. ThreadX has its own reviewed M4/Native subset"
" and masking policy, not the FreeRTOS port or tickless/isolation capability "
"set."
msgstr ""
"FIG-08 表示当前 wait/唤醒责任。提供者 IRQ 接收端必须遵守选定内核系统调用优先级阈值；不合法优先级不得调用 ISR 内核 "
"API。ThreadX 有自己复核的 M4/Native 子集和屏蔽策略，不继承 FreeRTOS 端口或 tickless/isolation "
"能力集。"

msgid "Shut down in dependency order"
msgstr "按依赖顺序停机"

msgid "Close client admission and reject new work without borrowing it."
msgstr "关闭客户端准入，不借用地拒绝新工作。"

msgid ""
"Keep the resource owner/executor running. Request cancellation using stable "
"slots and matching epochs; cancellation does not release accepted storage."
msgstr "保持资源 owner/执行者运行。通过稳定槽与匹配 epoch 请求取消；取消不释放已接受的存储。"

msgid ""
"Drain transfers and block loans. Acquire-observe SETTLED and read results. A"
" failed drain retains QUARANTINED storage and explicit recovery "
"responsibility."
msgstr "排空传输和块借用。Acquire 观察 SETTLED 并读取结果。失败排空保留 QUARANTINED 存储和明确恢复责任。"

msgid ""
"Join producers and detach/join control observers before slot or request "
"reuse."
msgstr "复用槽或请求前，join 生产者并 detach/join 控制观察者。"

msgid ""
"Stop and join the owner. Quiesce hardware IRQ publishers before destroying "
"their notification, queue, guard, stack or TCB storage."
msgstr "停止并 join owner。销毁通知、队列、临界区保护、栈或 TCB 存储前，确保硬件 IRQ 发布者停止访问并完成必要同步。"

msgid ""
"Stop platform providers only when their selected lifetime and kernel "
"clock/Tick ownership permit it. A running scheduler is not stopped by "
"ordinary I/O teardown."
msgstr "只有选定生命周期与内核时钟/Tick 所有权允许时才能停止 platform 提供者。普通 I/O 拆除不停止正在运行的调度器。"

msgid "Task return has a backend-specific implementation:"
msgstr "任务返回后的实现因后端而异："

msgid "Backend"
msgstr "后端"

msgid "After the application entry returns"
msgstr "应用入口返回后的行为"

msgid "External owner must prove"
msgstr "外部所有者必须证明"

msgid "Native"
msgstr "Native"

msgid "The pthread entry returns and the host thread terminates"
msgstr "pthread 入口返回，主机线程终止"

msgid "Successful `nx_native_task_join()`"
msgstr "`nx_native_task_join()` 成功"

msgid "FreeRTOS"
msgstr "FreeRTOS"

msgid ""
"The wrapper publishes its completion hint and suspends until the external "
"joiner deletes it"
msgstr "包装任务发布完成提示，然后挂起，直到外部 join 调用方将其删除"

msgid "Successful `nx_freertos_task_join()` and external kernel detachment"
msgstr "`nx_freertos_task_join()` 成功，且内核引用已在外部解除"

msgid "ThreadX"
msgstr "ThreadX"

msgid ""
"The wrapper publishes its return predicate and completion hint, then follows"
" the kernel completion path"
msgstr "包装任务发布返回谓词和完成提示，然后进入内核完成路径"

msgid ""
"Successful `nx_threadx_task_join()`; the hint alone does not prove ready-"
"list detachment"
msgstr "`nx_threadx_task_join()` 成功；提示本身不能证明任务已经脱离就绪链表"

msgid ""
"Returning from an entry function or observing a completion hint never "
"authorizes stack/TCB reclamation. Keep wrapper, stack and kernel-control "
"storage until the one external lifecycle owner successfully joins it. Raw "
"queues and closable queues have different lifecycle contracts; close is not "
"destruction. Keep all storage on the failure path and retry cleanup only "
"through its real owner."
msgstr ""
"入口函数返回或观察到完成提示，都不允许回收栈／TCB。必须保留包装对象、栈和内核控制存储，直到唯一的外部生命周期所有者成功 "
"join。原始队列和可关闭队列的生命周期合同不同；关闭不等于销毁。失败路径保留全部存储，只能由真实所有者重试清理。"

msgid "Execute maintained software fixtures"
msgstr "执行维护中的软件夹具"

msgid ""
"First prepare the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](source-"
"checkout.md). From that repository root, with host build tools available:"
msgstr "先准备[固定源码与递归依赖](source-checkout.md)。然后从该仓库根目录、在主机构建工具可用的条件下执行："

msgid ""
"Both binaries must execute nonempty passing cases. This targeted development"
" scope does not replace the complete TDD gate. The external UART owner "
"application in [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples)"
" supplies product workers; its pin/revision must be recorded before claiming"
" consumer execution."
msgstr ""
"两个可执行文件都必须实际执行非空且全部通过的用例。此定向开发范围不替代完整 TDD 门禁。[nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples) 的外部 UART owner "
"应用提供产品执行任务；声明消费工程执行前必须记录其固定源码版本。"

msgid ""
"Physical scheduler context, IRQ ceiling, FP/MVE retention, stack peaks and "
"wake latency require real station evidence. Do not inherit POSIX behavior as"
" MCU timing."
msgstr "物理调度器上下文、IRQ 优先级阈值、FP/MVE 保留、栈峰值和唤醒延迟需要真实工位证据。不得将 POSIX 行为继承为 MCU 时序。"
